    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Zero-registration constant-envelope arbitrage (`arb_auto`):\\nOuter transaction carries only fixed `(user, token, legs, salt)` with empty `sub_invocations`.\\nOn-chain VM solves optimal `best_in`, pulls via `transfer_from` (or contract balance),\\nexecutes `legs`, enforces `realized_out > best_in`, and returns `realized_out` to `user`.",
